---
export interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className = "" } = Astro.props;
---

<!-- AnciCare Legacy Section - Mobile Optimized -->
<section class={`py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white ${className}`}>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 sm:mb-6"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Same Founders. Bigger Mission. Perfect Timing.
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        The model we built was so effective, CorVel still operates it today—20+
        years after acquiring us. Now we're back to solve an even bigger
        problem.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-12 items-center">
      <div data-aos="fade-right">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
          What's Changed Since We Sold AnciCare
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">📈</span>
            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base">
              <strong>Self-insurance democratized:</strong> No longer just Fortune
              500—now 20,000+ mid-market companies
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">💸</span>
            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base">
              <strong>Deductibles destroyed access:</strong> $6,500 average means
              employees can't afford care
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">🚨</span>
            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base">
              <strong>90 million left behind:</strong> Uninsured + underinsured =
              massive care gap
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">🏥</span>
            <div class="text-sm sm:text-base">
              <strong>Hospital consolidation won:</strong> Imaging costs up 312%
              while quality stayed flat
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div data-aos="fade-left">
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl"
        >
          <div class="bg-[#cc9933]/10 rounded-lg p-3 sm:p-4 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#cc9933]">
              THE ULTIMATE VALIDATION
            </p>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
              CorVel (NASDAQ: CRVL) still uses our AnciCare model today—20+ years
              later
            </p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4">
            Why We Came Back
          </h3>
          <blockquote
            class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700 italic mb-4 sm:mb-6"
          >
            "We built something so good, it's still the industry standard two
            decades later. But watching 90 million Americans unable to afford
            basic imaging? That's a problem we couldn't ignore. The same model
            that transformed workers' comp can now transform healthcare access
            for everyone."
          </blockquote>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">
            — Michael & Donna Cabrera, USRad Founders
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
            Previously built AnciCare, served 150,000+ claimants, created the
            managed imaging category
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Proof Points -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6 mt-12 sm:mt-16"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-delay="200"
    >
      <div class="text-center">
        <div
          class="w-16 sm:w-20 h-16 sm:h-20 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 sm:mb-4"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">🏆</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">1994</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
          First managed imaging network
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div
          class="w-16 sm:w-20 h-16 sm:h-20 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 sm:mb-4"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">📊</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">150,000+</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">Claimants served</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div
          class="w-16 sm:w-20 h-16 sm:h-20 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 sm:mb-4"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">💰</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">50-70%</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
          Cost reductions delivered
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div
          class="w-16 sm:w-20 h-16 sm:h-20 bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 sm:mb-4"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">✅</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#cc9933]">
          20+ Years
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600">
          Model still operating
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
